                "original_url": "https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/posts\/domitilledesaintexupery_big-news-lemlist-is-acquiring-claap-the-activity-7386079509961138176-MDt6?utm_source=share&amp;utm_medium=member_desktop&amp;rcm=ACoAAAnsW90Bnm55kWM6bLrKCo5bHe8B66FiXxI",
                "fallback": "Big news: lemlist is acquiring Claap, the AI Sales Conversation Intelligence challenger.  Two years ago, when we started building our sales team at lemlist, we tested dozens of recording tools out… | Domitille de Saint-Exupéry",
                "text": "Big news: lemlist is acquiring Claap, the AI Sales Conversation Intelligence challenger.\n\nTwo years ago, when we started building our sales team at lemlist, we tested dozens of recording tools out there.\n\nEach had its strengths and weaknesses.\n\nThen we tried Claap… and the product was years ahead.\n\n→ Transcripts that were freakishly accurate\n→ CRM auto-filled without errors\n\nThe product worked so well our sales reps used it without being forced to.\n\nBecause it genuinely makes their lives easier.\n\nWhen we found out they built all of this with a 7-person team, we thought:\n“Ok, this is crazy. More sales teams need to hear about this.”\n\nSo our CEO Charles called Robin, Claap’s CEO.\n\nWhat started as a chat between two product nerds turned into something bigger: a shared vision.\n\nA vision we now call Smartbound.\n\nWhere sales teams don’t rely on sending more messages, but on better timing and real context coming from the best intel they have:\n\ntheir own conversations.\n\nWhere the insights you collect on calls don’t die in a notebook, or disappear with your rep when they leave.\n\nClaap captures everything that’s said: objections, buying signals, follow-up dates… and turns it into structured data.\n\nlemlist then uses that context to help you reach out to the right person, at the right time, with the right message.\n\nNo more “spray and pray.”\n\nNo more starting from zero every time you contact a prospect.\n\nTogether, we’re building the next generation of outbound: one that’s driven by context, not volume.\n\nLet's do this!",
                "title": "Big news: lemlist is acquiring Claap, the AI Sales Conversation Intelligence challenger.  Two years ago, when we started building our sales team at lemlist, we tested dozens of recording tools out… | Domitille de Saint-Exupéry",
